<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>通知悬浮气泡</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>通知悬浮气泡 · 0.48.5</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>单击打开通知或 App；边缘缩回时长按可拖动位置，展开后及分屏图标长按清除。分屏切换保持原顺序，仅高亮当前 App。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用悬浮气泡</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Enabled</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>显示位置</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>锁屏关闭仅隐藏气泡，通知仍会收集，进入允许显示的桌面或 App 后出现。总开关关闭会清理全部图标。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>锁屏显示</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ShowOnLock</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>主屏显示</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ShowOnHome</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>App 内显示</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ShowInApps</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>图标外观</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>大小范围 32–80 点，默认 48 点；不透明度范围 20%–100%，越低越透明。修改即时生效。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>图标大小</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>IconSize</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>48</integer>
			<key>min</key>
			<integer>32</integer>
			<key>max</key>
			<integer>80</integer>
			<key>showValue</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>图标不透明度</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>IconOpacity</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>1.0</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>0.2</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>1.0</real>
			<key>showValue</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>气泡与角标</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>单击图标同时伸出并执行打开操作，不等待动画结束。边缘缩回时长按拖动整组位置；伸出后及分屏图标长按清除图标及对应 App。不使用双击。伸出停留 1 秒。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>清除全部气泡</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>clearBubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>分屏切换</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>开启后，只关闭上一个仍展开的竖屏分屏窗口，不终止 App 后台。左上角、右上角小窗及横屏窗口均保留；状态无法确认时也保留。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>切换时关闭上一个竖屏窗口</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ClosePreviousSplit</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>排列规则</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>边缘容器显示 3 个图标，未读图标在外；分屏容器显示 7 个，均可上下滚动。横屏和小窗不吸附；伸出停留 1 秒。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>分屏与截屏</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>冻屏只在分屏背景为桌面时禁止桌面触摸并添加轻微模糊，背景为全屏 App 时不限制。截屏隐藏所有气泡、未读角标、容器及清理按钮，不隐藏分屏 App；系统机制也可能隐藏录屏中的气泡。两个开关默认关闭。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>分屏时冻结桌面</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>FreezeDesktop</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>截屏隐藏气泡</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>HideInScreenshots</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
